                                "example_id": "164b9cae-535e-4269-af00-2b54ef71a420",
                                "sense_id": "edd6196d-e205-32e9-a8b8-6079723d8f1f",
                                "text": "\"But on Friday, a three-judge panel of the court unanimously reversed his ruling, saying the judiciary must defer to the government’s assertions that, for security reasons, guards needed to conduct more thorough searches; under the old procedures, guards shook inmates’ underwear to dislodge any contraband but did not touch their buttocks or genitals.\""
